el to your dog's gut. This is THE ingredient that stops digestion problems at the source</p><p><strong>The science:</strong> CPC reduces oral bacteria by up to 95% – preventing millions of bacteria from being swallowed daily</p><p><strong>Cheap alternatives:</strong> Skip effective antibacterials entirely or use harsh chemicals that irritate</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDihASPPgA_text","label":"ggDihASPPgA_text","default":"<p>Tea Polyphenols &amp; Green Tea Extract</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEeDOV_nuf_text","label":"ggEeDOV_nuf_text","default":"<p><strong>What it is:</strong> Natural compounds from green tea with powerful antibacterial properties</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Works alongside CPC to fight bacteria naturally, PLUS provides antioxidants that support gum health</p><p><strong>Bonus:</strong> Freshens breath naturally without artificial fragrances that dogs hate</p><p><strong>Cheap alternatives:</strong> Artificial fragrances and flavors that cause refusal or nausea</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWykTEMwnK_text","label":"ggWykTEMwnK_text","default":"<p>Glycerin</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggonn6GBhNA_text","label":"ggonn6GBhNA_text","default":"<p><strong>What it is:</strong> Natural moisture-retaining ingredient</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Keeps wipes moist and effective while being gentle on gums. Prevents drying or irritation that releases MORE bacteria</p><p><strong>Safe profile:</strong> Food-grade glycerin – safe if small amounts are ingested during cleaning</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWtdhimVdN_text","label":"ggWtdhimVdN_text","default":"<p>Citric Acid (pH Balancing)</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjZ3KLwMTj_text","label":"ggjZ3KLwMTj_text","default":"<p><strong>What it is:</strong> Natural acid that balances pH levels</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Maintains optimal pH (not too acidic, not too alkaline) to protect tooth enamel AND prevent stomach upset if trace amounts are swallowed</p><p><strong>The detail:</strong> Properly balanced pH = no burning sensation = dog accepts cleaning calmly</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7h-yGKWhQ_text","label":"gg7h-yGKWhQ_text","default":"<p>Allantoin</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdo8Y1P1LK_text","label":"ggdo8Y1P1LK_text","default":"<p><strong>What it is:</strong> Natural soothing compound found in plants</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Soothes inflamed gums and promotes healing. Inflamed gums = more bacteria released into bloodstream and gut</p><p><strong>The connection:</strong> Healthier gums = less bacterial load = better digestion</p><p><strong>Cheap alternatives:</strong> No soothing ingredients – more irritation, more bacteria, worse results</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdplo66XFD_label","label":"ggdplo66XFD_label","default":"<p>Get Premium FreshWipes – Save Up To 70%</p>"}],
